// SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
// examples/bench_android/main.fi -- Android benchmark app, Firn + fUi side (spec: projects_kb/fui/bench_spec.md).
//
// Three tabs (List, Lab, Settings) like the Kotlin Compose twin (bench/android_kotlin). 1000 card rows in ONE virtual list, Lab with
// Anim / Text / Net / CPU, test hooks through intent extras (plat.intentx) and BENCH log lines (plat.blog, logcat tag BENCH).
//
// ONE THREAD: the window, the network (async.ahttp) and the CPU benchmark (bcpu: nine kernels on a worker thread) all run on the window loop. A 16 ms loop
// timer exists ONLY while something moves (Anim page, CPU run, autoscroll) -- an idle page costs no frames.
